&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;reading time : 22 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People often ask me how much my AI usage costs. I reply &quot;20 bucks a month&quot; and they stare at me with wide eyes. So today, I&amp;#8217;m opening the black box for you. This article is the full audit of my 73 days of vibe coding: the methodology for extracting data from OpenCode&amp;#8217;s SQLite database, the SQL code to query the tables, and an exhaustive comparison with &lt;strong&gt;all&lt;/strong&gt; market providers — Western and Chinese. The result is so asymmetric that I had to double-check my calculations three times.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;OCD&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_understanding_the_stack_who_does_what&quot;&gt;Understanding the Stack: Who Does What?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before diving into the numbers, let&amp;#8217;s clarify the architecture. There are three distinct actors in my setup, and it&amp;#8217;s important not to confuse them:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Failed to generate image: PlantUML preprocessing failed: [From &amp;lt;input&amp;gt; (line 10) ]

@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title The Three Actors of My LLM Stack
left to right direction

actor &quot;Me (Developer)&quot; as Dev

package &quot;OpenCode
^^^^^
 Syntax Error? (Assumed diagram type: component)

