&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even the cheapest provider on HuggingFace (Novita) charges 19× the price of my subscription. And unlike Ollama Cloud, HuggingFace also charges &lt;strong&gt;in addition&lt;/strong&gt; the platform fees if you don&amp;#8217;t have a HF PRO subscription ($9/month).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
