&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even with DeepSeek&amp;#8217;s aggressive promotion (extended -75%), the direct API costs&lt;strong&gt;5×&lt;/strong&gt;more expensive. At the normal rate,&lt;strong&gt;20×&lt;/strong&gt;. And it&amp;#8217;s &lt;strong&gt;only&lt;/strong&gt; DeepSeek — no access to other models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_kimi_moonshot_platform_kimi_com&quot;&gt;Kimi Moonshot (platform.kimi.com)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kimi only offers its own models. No DeepSeek.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_alibaba_bailian_bailian_aliyun_com&quot;&gt;Alibaba Bailian (bailian.aliyun.com)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only provider that aggregates all Chinese models — but via resale with margin. Prices are loaded dynamically in JavaScript, making scraping impossible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
