&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_option_3_the_composite_build_includebuild_the_composite_build&quot;&gt;Option 3: The Composite Build (&lt;code&gt;includeBuild()&lt;/code&gt;) The Composite Build&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
