|===

**Overall efficiency factor: 5-8×**— in felt developer productivity

[NOTE]
====
The factor is not measured in tokens or dollars. It is measured in &quot;how much time I spend explaining to the model what it should already know&quot;. With fine‑tuned models, this time tends toward zero.
====

