&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;reading time : 18 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The battle of LLMs also plays out in a developer&amp;#8217;s terminal. Not on sterile academic benchmarks. In real life: a 30,000‑token prompt, an agent governance in AsciiDoc, Gradle Kotlin DSL plugins to debug, and sessions that chain over three weeks. I tested for you DeepSeek‑V4‑Pro, Kimi K2.6 and GLM‑5.1. Here is the verdict, backed by technical evidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;knock&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_context_not_a_test_bench_a_worksite&quot;&gt;Context: not a test bench, a worksite&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Three weeks ago, I was working on`codebase-gradle`, my meta-build system that centralizes the YAML configuration of four projects: a PlantUML README generator, an AsciiDoc slide builder, a JBake static site, and an LLM chatbot. The Opencode agent, governed by my agent-files methodology in AsciiDoc, loaded ~30K tokens of EAGER context at the start of each session — absolute rules, backlog, history of the last 10 sessions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It&amp;#8217;s on this field that I confronted three models:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kimi K2.6&lt;/strong&gt;(Moonshot AI, 1T params / 32B activated, 256K max context, MLA) - &lt;strong&gt;GLM-5.1&lt;/strong&gt;(Zhipu AI/Tsinghua, 744B params / DSA, 200K max context) - &lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek-V4-Pro&lt;/strong&gt;(DeepSeek, 1.6T parameters / 49B activated, 1M max context, CSA+HCA)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All served via Ollama on cloud server, all in thinking mode (reasoning phase activated). The challenge: produce correct code, maintain consistency over long sessions, and avoid hallucination when the context exceeds 80K tokens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_my_test_environment&quot;&gt;My test environment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;diag-dev-env&quot; class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Failed to generate image: PlantUML preprocessing failed: [From &amp;lt;input&amp;gt; (line 11) ]

