&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two levels of compression, two attention granularities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CSA&lt;/strong&gt;compress the KV cache all the`m`tokens, then applies a sparse attention (DeepSeek Sparse Attention) — only the top-k of the compressed entries is consulted. Precise, local, efficient. - &lt;strong&gt;HCA&lt;/strong&gt;extreme compression (factor`m&#39;`much larger than`m`), but pay attention to the dense attention on the compressed residue — keep the global connections without quadratic explosion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Result: at 1M tokens, DeepSeek-V4-Pro consumes only&lt;strong&gt;27% of inference FLOPs&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;10% of the size of the KV cache&lt;/strong&gt;compared to DeepSeek-V3.2. The previous model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And most importantly, the technical report (Figure 9) states: &lt;em&gt;&quot;_Retrieval performance remains highly stable within a 128K context window.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_sessions_1_8_relief&quot;&gt;Sessions 1-8: relief&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I spent eight sessions with DeepSeek-V4-Pro on`codebase-gradle`. Eight sessions without a single hallucination, without a single invented class, without a single naming confusion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Session 1: implementation of`CodebaseYmlConfig` et &lt;code&gt;CodebaseYmlAnonymizer&lt;/code&gt;. 350 lines of Kotlin, inline tests, all compiles. Session 4 : adding the`SnapshotManager`with tree view, file collection, AsciiDoc rendering per file. 279 lines, zero error. Session 7: debug of the`renderFileSection()`who had to handle four different types of anonymisers without resolution ambiguity. Resolved in three messages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The latency is higher than Kimi — about 10-12 seconds per response in thinking mode. But the correction rate is almost zero. I don&amp;#8217;t spend my time fixing the agent&amp;#8217;s errors. I code &lt;strong&gt;with&lt;/strong&gt; him.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_the_decisive_test_refactoring_at_100k_tokens&quot;&gt;The decisive test: refactoring at 100K tokens&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At session 8, the cumulative context exceeds 100K tokens. I request a heavy refactoring: extract the four inline verification tasks of`build.gradle.kts`toward JUnit5 test files in`buildSrc/src/test/`.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The agent proposes a three-phase plan:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create the test classes with migration of existing cases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add the JUnit5 and Kotest dependencies in`buildSrc/build.gradle.kts`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remove the inline code of`build.gradle.kts`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The plan is correct. The execution is clean. It even identifies an edge case I had missed: duplicate Jackson dependencies between`buildscript {}` et `buildSrc/build.gradle.kts`which must be unified during the migration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;100K tokens of context, and the agent remembers that`CodebaseYmlAnonymizer.TOKEN_MASK`is`&quot;&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;`, that`GitConfig.resolvedToken()&lt;code&gt;is an extension function defined in`readme.kt&lt;/code&gt;, and that`SnapshotManager.PRUNED_DIRS`excludes`build`, &lt;code&gt;.gradle&lt;/code&gt; et &lt;code&gt;.git&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&amp;#8217;s the difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_face_to_face_comparative_metrics&quot;&gt;Face-to-face: Comparative Metrics&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Criterion&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Kimi K2.6&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;GLM-5.1&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;DeepSeek-V4-Pro&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Context max&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;256K&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;200K&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;1M&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
