&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_the_audit_dissecting_the_627_lines&quot;&gt;The audit: dissecting the 627 lines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_the_fear_of_losing_the_engineering&quot;&gt;The fear of losing the engineering&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_the_solution_encyclopedic_split&quot;&gt;The solution: encyclopedic split&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
