&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The verdict is final:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complete duplicates&lt;/strong&gt;(167 lines) : P3, P4, P9 — everything is already in`AGENT.adoc` ou &lt;code&gt;INDEX.adoc&lt;/code&gt;, often word for word&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Never consulted in practice&lt;/strong&gt;(215 lines): P5, P6, P7, P8, Annexes — meta‑governance that has never been used in any session&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;(161 lines) : P1 and P2 — the LAZY/EAGER vocabulary, the analogy, the loading policy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On 627 lines,&lt;strong&gt;382 are noise&lt;/strong&gt;. And these 382 lines are loaded &lt;strong&gt;at each session start&lt;/strong&gt;, consumed by the agent, diluting his attention even before I say hello.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;diag-audit-result&quot; class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
