This assumed redundancy is a design choice. It consumes about 50 extra lines of EAGER tokens — but it ensures that the agent always has the rules in view, even in the concise format that facilitates immediate obedience.

=== The LAZY Files: The Owner&#39;s Manual

These files live in`.agents/`and are read only when the agent needs them. They constitute the true wealth of the method, because they accumulate the project&#39;s knowledge without polluting the current context.

[plantuml, format=svg, id=diag-agents-tree, alt=&quot;Arborescence complète du dossier .agents/&quot;]
----
