&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_the_best_of_both_worlds&quot;&gt;The Best of Both Worlds&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This architecture gives you :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 The Velocity of Supabase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Starting in hours, not in weeks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OAuth2 authentication in a few clicks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Automatically generated REST APIs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zero server configuration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;�💪 The Power of Spring Boot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kotlin and Coroutines for elegant asynchronous code&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Orchestration of complex business processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reliable scheduled jobs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guaranteed ACID transactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Complete Spring ecosystem&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;�💰 The Progressive Economy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;0€ to start and validate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Costs that follow growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No premature over-engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;�🎯 Architectural Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Progressive migration without redesign&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adding Spring Boot only if necessary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No total vendor lock-in&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;evolutionary architecture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_to_go_further&quot;&gt;To Go Further&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_technical_resources&quot;&gt;Technical Resources&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supabase Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth&quot;&gt;Authentication Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://supabase.com/docs/guides/database/postgres/row-level-security&quot;&gt;Row Level Security&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://supabase.com/docs/guides/api&quot;&gt;Auto-generated APIs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spring Boot Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://spring.io/guides/tutorials/spring-boot-kotlin/&quot;&gt;Spring Boot with Kotlin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://spring.io/blog/2019/04/12/going-reactive-with-spring-coroutines-and-kotlin-flow&quot;&gt;Coroutines and Spring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/reference/servlet/oauth2/resource-server/jwt.html&quot;&gt;JWT Resource Server&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplementary Articles :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Securing APIs with JWT&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PostgreSQL performance optimization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Progressive migration patterns&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Error handling in distributed architecture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_real_use_cases&quot;&gt;Real Use Cases&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This hybrid architecture is successfully used in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SaaS B2B&lt;/strong&gt;: Authentication Supabase, billing Spring Boot&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketplaces&lt;/strong&gt;: Supabase catalog, Spring Boot transactions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content platforms&lt;/strong&gt;: Articles Supabase, analytics Spring Boot&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal tools&lt;/strong&gt;: CRUD Supabase, workflows Spring Boot&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_startup_checklist&quot;&gt;Startup Checklist&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phase 1 - Foundations (Week 1)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist checklist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;checklist&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa fa-square-o&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Create Supabase account - [ ] Configure PostgreSQL project - [ ] Enable Auth (Google, GitHub) - [ ] Define initial schema - [ ] Configure Row Level Security - [ ] Test APIs from JBake&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phase 2 - MVP (Week 2-3)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist checklist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;checklist&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa fa-square-o&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Implement main pages - [ ] Integrate OAuth2 authentication - [ ] Create CRUD forms - [ ] Configure Storage for files - [ ] Deploy on GitHub Pages - [ ] Test in real conditions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Phase 3 - Evolution (As needed)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist checklist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;checklist&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa fa-square-o&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Identify complex logic needs - [ ] Create Spring Boot project if necessary - [ ] Configure Supabase JWT validation - [ ] Connect to Supabase PostgreSQL - [ ] Migrate complex features - [ ] Implement scheduled jobs - [ ] Deploy Spring Boot (Cloud Run, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_anti_patterns_to_avoid&quot;&gt;Anti-Patterns to Avoid&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;❌ Do not:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duplicate data between Supabase and Spring Boot&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create two separate PostgreSQL databases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Code the authentication yourself&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use Spring Boot for simple CRUD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over-architect from the start&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ignore Row Level Security of Supabase&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Better to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Share a single PostgreSQL database&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let Supabase handle authentication&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use Spring Boot only for the complexity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Start simple, evolve gradually&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leverage the strengths of each technology&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Secure with RLS at database level&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_evolution_prospects&quot;&gt;Evolution prospects&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_adding_new_capabilities&quot;&gt;Adding New Capabilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;future-capabilities.svg&quot; alt=&quot;future capabilities&quot; width=&quot;1787&quot; height=&quot;5688&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_horizontal_scaling&quot;&gt;horizontal scaling&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As your application grows, the hybrid architecture scales naturally:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supabase:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scale automatically up to millions of operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Read replicas for read performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Point-in-time recovery for security&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spring Boot:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multiple instances behind load balancer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stateless design facilitates horizontal scaling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kubernetes for orchestration if needed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PostgreSQL :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partitioning for large tables&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Connection pooling (PgBouncer)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sharding only if really necessary (rare)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_architectural_testimonies&quot;&gt;Architectural Testimonies&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_saas_startup_50k_users&quot;&gt;SaaS startup (50k users)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;_ We started 100% Supabase. At 5k users, we added Spring Boot only for Stripe billing and monthly reports. One year later, 80% of our operations still go through Supabase. Spring Boot handles only the critical part. This separation allowed us to scale without a rewrite. &lt;/em&gt;_&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_e_learning_platform_10k_users&quot;&gt;E-learning platform (10k users)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;_ Supabase OAuth2 authentication saved us 3 weeks of development. The auto-generated APIs handle our entire course catalog. Spring Boot is only used for PDF certificates and progress emails. Simple, maintainable, scalable architecture. &lt;/em&gt;_&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_marketplace_b2b_3k_users&quot;&gt;Marketplace B2B (3k users)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;_ Spring Boot manages transactions between buyers and sellers (critical). Supabase handles everything else: profiles, real‑time messaging, documents. The fact that they share the same PostgreSQL database eliminates the need for complex synchronization on our end. This is the best architectural decision we have made. &lt;/em&gt;_&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_synthesis_a_modern_architectural_paradigm&quot;&gt;Synthesis: A Modern Architectural Paradigm&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hybrid Supabase + Spring Boot architecture represents a new paradigm :&lt;strong&gt;architectural specialization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Failed to generate image: PlantUML preprocessing failed: [From &amp;lt;input&amp;gt; (line 20) ]

