&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_option_4_html_injection_selected_solution&quot;&gt;Option 4 : HTML injection (selected solution)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_the_solution_html_injection_with&quot;&gt;The solution: HTML injection with &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_operating_principle&quot;&gt;Operating principle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_implementation&quot;&gt;Implementation&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_explanation_of_css_properties&quot;&gt;Explanation of CSS properties&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_complete_example&quot;&gt;Complete example&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_optimizations_and_best_practices&quot;&gt;Optimizations and best practices&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_manage_the_light_colors&quot;&gt;Manage the light colors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_adjust_the_size_of_the_squares&quot;&gt;Adjust the size of the squares&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_create_variants&quot;&gt;Create variants&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_colored_circle&quot;&gt;Colored circle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_square_with_colored_border&quot;&gt;Square with colored border&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_solution_architecture&quot;&gt;Solution architecture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_advantages_and_limitations&quot;&gt;Advantages and limitations&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_advantages&quot;&gt;Advantages&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_limitations&quot;&gt;Limitations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_accessibility_improvement&quot;&gt;Accessibility improvement&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_concrete_example_documentation_of_themes&quot;&gt;Concrete example: Documentation of themes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_conclusion&quot;&gt;Conclusion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_resources&quot;&gt;Resources&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_introduction&quot;&gt;Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When writing technical documentation, particularly for style guides or user interface specifications, it is common to need to display color palettes. AsciiDoc, although very powerful for documentation, does not provide a native syntax for displaying color samples. This article explores the problem and proposes an elegant solution based on HTML injection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_the_problem&quot;&gt;The problem&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_context_of_use&quot;&gt;Context of use&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imagine you are documenting the CSS variables of a web application theme. You need to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;List the hexadecimal color codes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Display a visual preview of each color&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain the readability of the source document&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure compatibility with static site generators like JBake&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;use-case-diagram.svg&quot; alt=&quot;use case diagram&quot; width=&quot;960&quot; height=&quot;197&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_possible_approaches&quot;&gt;Possible approaches&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Several solutions can be considered to display colors in an AsciiDoc document:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;component-diagram.svg&quot; alt=&quot;component diagram&quot; width=&quot;823&quot; height=&quot;190&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_option_1_unicode_characters&quot;&gt;Option 1: Unicode characters&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The use of Unicode characters as`&amp;#9632;`(■) is simple but limited:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* ■ --accent-color: #7952b3 (violet Bootstrap)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Limitations&lt;/strong&gt; : No control over the color, depends on the system font.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_option_2_external_images&quot;&gt;Option 2 : External images&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create PNG or SVG images for each color :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* image:colors/violet.svg[width=16] --accent-color: #7952b3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Limitations&lt;/strong&gt; : Heavy maintenance, proliferation of files, no automatic synchronization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_option_3_custom_css_roles&quot;&gt;Option 3 : Custom CSS roles&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define CSS classes and apply them via AsciiDoc roles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* [.color-violet]##■## --accent-color: #7952b3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Limitations&lt;/strong&gt; : Requires an external style sheet, prior definition of all possible colors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_option_4_html_injection_selected_solution&quot;&gt;Option 4 : HTML injection (selected solution)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use the macro``to inject HTML with inline styles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;
background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;]
--accent-color: #7952b3 (violet Bootstrap)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_the_solution_html_injection_with&quot;&gt;The solution: HTML injection with &lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_operating_principle&quot;&gt;Operating principle&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The macro``AsciiDoc allows inserting raw content that will not be interpreted by the AsciiDoc processor. This lets us inject HTML directly with inline CSS styles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Failed to generate image: PlantUML preprocessing failed: [From &amp;lt;input&amp;gt; (line 2) ]

@startuml
participant &quot;Document
^^^^^
 Syntax Error? (Assumed diagram type: sequence)

@startuml
participant &quot;Document
AsciiDoc&quot; as doc
participant &quot;Processor
AsciiDoc&quot; as processor
participant &quot;pass:[] macro&quot; as pass
participant &quot;HTML
final&quot; as html

doc -&amp;gt; processor : Analyse document
processor -&amp;gt; pass : Détecte pass:[]
pass -&amp;gt; processor : Retourne HTML brut
processor -&amp;gt; html : Insère sans transformation
html -&amp;gt; html : Navigateur applique styles
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_implementation&quot;&gt;Implementation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here is the HTML structure to inject:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;
             width:1em;
             height:1em;
             background:#7952b3;
             vertical-align:middle;
             margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_explanation_of_css_properties&quot;&gt;Explanation of CSS properties&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 75%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Property&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Function&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;display:inline-block&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Allows setting width/height while staying in the inline flow&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;width:1em; height:1em&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Size of the square relative to the font size (responsive)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;background:#7952b3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;The color to display (variable according to your needs)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;vertical-align:middle&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Align the square with the adjacent text&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;margin-right:0.5em&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Spacing between the square and the text&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_complete_example&quot;&gt;Complete example&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here is an example documenting a theme palette:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;== Thème Clair

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#f8f9fa` (blanc cassé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#212529` (noir très foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#7952b3` (violet Bootstrap)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#61428f;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-hover: `#61428f` (violet plus foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --card-bg: `#ffffff` (blanc)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Producing the following rendering:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Light Theme&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --bg-primary:`#f8f9fa`(off-white)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --text-primary:`#212529`(very dark black)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --accent-color:`#7952b3`(violet Bootstrap)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#61428f;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --accent-hover:`#61428f`(darker violet)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --card-bg:`#ffffff`(white)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_optimizations_and_best_practices&quot;&gt;Optimizations and best practices&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_manage_the_light_colors&quot;&gt;Manage the light colors&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For very light colors (white, very light gray), add a border to make them visible on a white background:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;
background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #ccc;
vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The gray border`border:1px solid #ccc`) allows to outline the white square on a white background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_adjust_the_size_of_the_squares&quot;&gt;Adjust the size of the squares&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can adjust the size of the squares according to your needs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1.5em;height:1.5em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Grand carré
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:0.8em;height:0.8em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Petit carré&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The use of the unit`em`ensures that the squares adapt to the font size.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_create_variants&quot;&gt;Create variants&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For specific needs, you can create different shapes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_colored_circle&quot;&gt;Colored circle&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Cercle violet&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_square_with_colored_border&quot;&gt;Square with colored border&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:3px solid #7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Bordure violette&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_solution_architecture&quot;&gt;Solution architecture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;architecture-diagram.svg&quot; alt=&quot;architecture diagram&quot; width=&quot;483&quot; height=&quot;412&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_advantages_and_limitations&quot;&gt;Advantages and limitations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_advantages&quot;&gt;Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;�✓ &lt;strong&gt;Autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;: No dependence on external files&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;�✓ &lt;strong&gt;Portability&lt;/strong&gt; : Works with all AsciiDoc processors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;�✓ &lt;strong&gt;Synchronization&lt;/strong&gt; : The color code is directly in the HTML&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;�✓ &lt;strong&gt;Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt; : Complete style customization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;Maintenance&lt;/strong&gt; : Simple modification of the hexadecimal code&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;JBake Compatibility&lt;/strong&gt; : Works perfectly with static site generators&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_limitations&quot;&gt;Limitations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✗ &lt;strong&gt;Verbosity&lt;/strong&gt; : Repetitive HTML code in the AsciiDoc source&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✗ &lt;strong&gt;Source readability&lt;/strong&gt;: The source document is less streamlined.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✗ &lt;strong&gt;Accessibility&lt;/strong&gt; : No native alt text (to add manually)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_accessibility_improvement&quot;&gt;Accessibility improvement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To make the squares accessible to screen readers:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span role=&quot;img&quot; aria-label=&quot;Couleur violet Bootstrap&quot;
style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;
vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;]
--accent-color: `#7952b3` (violet Bootstrap)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The attributes`role=&quot;img&quot;` et `aria-label`allow assistive technologies to understand and describe visual content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_concrete_example_documentation_of_themes&quot;&gt;Concrete example: Documentation of themes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here is a complete example documenting several topics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;= Guide des couleurs de l&#39;application

== Thème Clair (`:root`)

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#f8f9fa` (blanc cassé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#212529` (noir très foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#7952b3` (violet Bootstrap)

== Thème Sombre (`[data-bs-theme=&quot;dark&quot;]`)

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#212529` (noir très foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #999;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#ffffff` (blanc)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#0d6efd;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#0d6efd` (bleu Bootstrap)

== Thème Contraste Élevé (`[data-bs-theme=&quot;high-contrast&quot;]`)

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#000000;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#000000` (noir)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #000;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#ffffff` (blanc)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#00ff00;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#00ff00` (vert vif)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_conclusion&quot;&gt;Conclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HTML injection via the macro``AsciiDoc offers an elegant and pragmatic solution for displaying color samples in technical documentation. Although slightly verbose, this approach ensures maximum portability and simplified maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This technique requires no external configuration, no additional stylesheet, and works immediately with JBake and all standard AsciiDoc processors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once you have created your first colored square, simply copy-paste the HTML code and modify the hexadecimal code to quickly create a full palette.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This technique can be extended to other use cases requiring custom visual rendering: icons, badges, simple charts, or any visual element requiring precise style control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
