&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_introduction&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_introduction&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Developing a Discord bot integrating the Spotify and YouTube APIs represents a modern technical challenge, especially given recent restrictions and platform evolutions. This article presents a methodological approach based on the&lt;strong&gt;Log Driven Development&lt;/strong&gt;(LDD), an extension of Test Driven Development, applied in a functional paradigm with Python.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal: create a robust, maintainable, and scalable bot capable of navigating the current constraints of music APIs while providing a smooth user experience on Discord.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_context_and_current_challenges&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_context_and_current_challenges&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Context and Current Challenges&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_evolution_of_music_apis&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_evolution_of_music_apis&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Evolution of Music APIs&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Music platforms have considerably tightened their access policies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spotify&lt;/strong&gt;: Restrictions on access to metadata, limitation of quotas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YouTube&lt;/strong&gt;: Strengthened anti-bot policy, complication of authentication&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discord&lt;/strong&gt;New security and performance requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_log_driven_development_approach&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_log_driven_development_approach&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Log Driven Development Approach&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LDD extends TDD by placing logs at the heart of development:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Definition of the logs&lt;/strong&gt;before the implementation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validation by observation&lt;/strong&gt;expected behaviors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complete traceability&lt;/strong&gt;data flows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive debugging&lt;/strong&gt;in anticipation of errors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_conceptual_architecture&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_conceptual_architecture&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Conceptual Architecture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;diag-plantuml-md5-3f14e5db3c058a87a04a62794fbd33ec.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;777&quot; height=&quot;618&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_technical_stack_and_functional_paradigm&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_technical_stack_and_functional_paradigm&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Technical Stack and Functional Paradigm&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_technological_choices&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_technological_choices&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Technological Choices&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our stack revolves around functional programming:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PyMonade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Managing side effects and function composition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pydantic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Type-safe data validation and serialization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asyncio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Asynchronous programming for APIs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structlog&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Structured logging for the LDD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_applied_functional_principles&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_applied_functional_principles&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Applied Functional Principles&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;diag-plantuml-md5-4abbd1cd8f30261d2d203a32f1900a6a.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;701&quot; height=&quot;554&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_agile_methodology_and_backlog&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_agile_methodology_and_backlog&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Agile Methodology and Backlog&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_main_epics&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_main_epics&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Main Epics&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our development is organized around 4 major epics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_epic_1_infrastructure_bot_discord&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_epic_1_infrastructure_bot_discord&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Epic 1: Infrastructure Bot Discord&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business value&lt;/strong&gt; : Solid and extensible base&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acceptance Criteria&lt;/strong&gt; : - Stable Discord connection with reconnection handling - Modular command system Integrated structured logging - Centralized error handling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_epic_2_spotify_integration&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_epic_2_spotify_integration&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Epic 2: Spotify Integration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business value&lt;/strong&gt; : Access to musical metadata&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acceptance criteria&lt;/strong&gt; : - Secure OAuth2 authentication - Track search with intelligent cache API quotas management - Fallback on network errors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_epic_3_youtube_integration&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_epic_3_youtube_integration&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Epic 3 : YouTube Integration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Valeur métier&lt;/strong&gt; : Access to audio content&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Acceptance criteria - Legal circumvention of restrictions Optimized audio extraction - Management of private/deleted videos - Respect of YouTube Terms of Service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_epic_4_musical_features&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_epic_4_musical_features&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Epic 4 : Musical Features&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business value&lt;/strong&gt;: Complete user experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acceptance criteria&lt;/strong&gt; : High-quality audio playback Smart reading queue - Discord voice commands - Cross-platform synchronization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_detailed_user_stories&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_detailed_user_stories&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Detailed User Stories&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_us1_1_bot_initialization&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_us1_1_bot_initialization&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;US1.1 : Bot initialization&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a&lt;/strong&gt; developer &lt;strong&gt;I want&lt;/strong&gt; a Discord bot that connects reliably &lt;strong&gt;In order to&lt;/strong&gt; ensure the availability of the service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DoD (Definition of Done)&lt;/strong&gt; : - [ ] Bot connects automatically on startup - [ ] Structured logs document each step - [ ] Automatic reconnection in case of disconnection - [ ] Integration tests pass&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_us2_1_intelligent_spotify_search&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_us2_1_intelligent_spotify_search&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;US2.1 : Intelligent Spotify Search&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a&lt;/strong&gt; Discord user &lt;strong&gt;I want&lt;/strong&gt; to search for tracks via Spotify &lt;strong&gt;In order to&lt;/strong&gt; discover and share music&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DoD&lt;/strong&gt;: - [ ] Order`/search`functional - [ ] Relevant results with metadata - [ ] Local cache to optimize queries - [ ] Graceful handling of API errors&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_us3_1_resilient_youtube_extraction&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_us3_1_resilient_youtube_extraction&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;US3.1: Resilient YouTube Extraction&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a&lt;/strong&gt; system &lt;strong&gt;I want&lt;/strong&gt; extract YouTube audio reliably &lt;strong&gt;In order to&lt;/strong&gt; maintain the continuity of the service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DoD&lt;/strong&gt; : - [ ] Extraction without violation of the ToS - [ ] Optimal audio quality - [ ] Management of geographic restrictions - [ ] Detailed logs of operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_log_driven_development_approach_2&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_log_driven_development_approach_2&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Log Driven Development Approach&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_logging_strategy&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_logging_strategy&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Logging Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;diag-plantuml-md5-fa1a25fd0143d0963cba00671e8ba111.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;687&quot; height=&quot;633&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_structure_of_the_logs&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_structure_of_the_logs&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Structure of the Logs&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our LDD approach uses structured logs with semantic levels:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;trace&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Detailed data flow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEBUG&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Internal states of the functions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;INFO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Successful business operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WARN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Degraded but managed situations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ERROR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Errors requiring intervention&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRITICAL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;System failures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_example_of_log_design&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_example_of_log_design&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Example of Log Design&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before implementing the Spotify search function, we define its logs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;INFO: spotify.search.start query=&quot;bohemian rhapsody&quot; user_id=123456
DEBUG: spotify.search.validation query_length=16 safe_chars=true
DEBUG: spotify.search.api_call endpoint=&quot;/search&quot; params={...}
INFO: spotify.search.success results_count=15 duration_ms=340&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_validation_architecture_with_pydantic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_validation_architecture_with_pydantic&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Validation Architecture with Pydantic&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_data_models&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_data_models&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Data Models&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our functional approach prioritizes upstream validation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;diag-plantuml-md5-ebd4e1dfbd7b19d5a6054ecf213e9e2d.png&quot; alt=&quot;Diagram&quot; width=&quot;696&quot; height=&quot;339&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
