&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_monads_and_error_handling&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;anchor&quot; href=&quot;#_monads_and_error_handling&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Monads and Error Handling&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using PyMonade allows elegant error handling:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
