&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_1_introduction_to_google_form_script&quot;&gt;1 - Introduction to Google Form Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_slide_1_quick_overview_of_google_form_script&quot;&gt;Slide 1: Quick overview of Google Form Script&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Google Form Script is a scripting platform integrated into Google Forms. - It allows adding custom features and automating tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_slide_2_presentation_of_the_main_features&quot;&gt;Slide 2: Presentation of the main features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Script Editor: The built-in script editor for writing Google Apps Script. - Triggers: Events like &quot;on submit&quot; that activate script execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_slide_3_advantages_of_using_google_form_script&quot;&gt;Slide 3: Advantages of using Google Form Script&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customization: Create custom forms with unique features. - Automation: Automate actions in response to form responses. - Integration: Integrate scripts with other Google services for a richer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_note_for_the_presenter&quot;&gt;Note for the presenter:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These features offer considerable potential for customizing and automating the forms. The rest of this training will explore in greater detail the creation of scripts and specific automations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.google.com/apps-script/add-ons/editors/forms?hl=en&quot; class=&quot;bare&quot;&gt;https://developers.google.com/apps-script/add-ons/editors/forms?hl=en&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.google.com/apps-script/reference/forms?hl=fr&quot; class=&quot;bare&quot;&gt;https://developers.google.com/apps-script/reference/forms?hl=fr&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.google.com/apps-script/reference/forms/form-app?hl=fr&quot; class=&quot;bare&quot;&gt;https://developers.google.com/apps-script/reference/forms/form-app?hl=fr&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
