&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;PyMonad is an implementation of monadic data structures in Python based on programming languages such as Haskell and F# with implementations for the most commonly used monad types in functional programming.https://www.miguelfarrajota.com/2021/06/monads-in-python-with-pymonad/[article]&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
