&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tutorial_on_collections_in_java&quot;&gt;Tutorial on collections in java&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.oracle.com/javase/tutorial/collections/index.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Collections&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The heart of the collection interfaces&lt;br&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;../../img/0036_training_kotlin_post/colls-coreInterfaces.gif&quot; alt=&quot;Collections&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
